# Talk inside a group, out of combat (kind group). Two audiences:
#  - in_player_group: the bot is in the real player's group and says it in /group. The player leads,
#    so these are warm and a little personal.
#  - in_group,!in_player_group: a bot group near the player, heard in /say.
# Combat calls ("add!", "mez") live in group_chatter.lines (kind combat). New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

# ---------------- In the player's group (/group) ----------------
@kind group
@topic group
@who *
# Hunting talk: not in a capital (live test 2026-10-18: "oom, give me a minute" in Camelot).
